[{"title":"喜闻古冲赴召兼订殊胜寺之约","author":"刘麟","text":"明王玄揽与天通，论相超然迈古风。\n望惬群心临翥凤，情深共语属冥鸿。\n最亲东出新迎日，不改商岩旧梦中。\n官府神仙恒断绝，言诗何地可追从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静虚院再集","author":"刘麟","text":"麦田铺翠寺门开，行尽松筠上佛阶。\n壶觞择胜人人醉，香火逢僧事事佳。\n豪吟渐觉随年薄，僻性终难与俗谐。\n春雷渐觉时惊听，犹有风云感旧怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同李半溪春社","author":"刘麟","text":"山亭共酌卧莓苔，灯市才收花又开。\n皓首屡承同社约，青毡犹记隔江来。\n?翁抱道真空世，白也言诗独擅才。\n欲把渔竿销蔗影，中阿堂畔有高台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"空明楼","author":"刘麟","text":"望中楼观倚天开，老恊山林胜事催。\n槛外风云扶雨过，梁间日月近人来。\n幽寻出世延诸佛，逸兴辞家近五台。\n已卜吾身有仙骨，青牙残醉斗边回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答李半溪","author":"刘麟","text":"丹灶非真诀，青蚨岂壮图。\n远心辞里巷，清兴落江湖。\n世网浮云隔，庭帏众美俱。\n綵服迎词客，华筵走静姝。\n素侯天富贵，黄发日欢娱。\n有子轻千乘，知翁压万夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠顾华玉","author":"刘麟","text":"彪炳得之子，郁然沧海精。\n词华追往哲，道范迪群英。\n雄章时倚马，声价日连城。\n簪组已文铎，铅丹仍短擎。\n郡借董孤笔，乡归李劭评。\n鞚发真千里，笼收擅八琼。\n偶遭倾盖语，遂辱断金盟。\n载酒论奇字，题铭谢大烹。\n移舟乘月曙，挥麈坐参横。\n幕卷霏微雨，灯挑长短更。\n一夕持衡去，三秋荐剡成。\n感时精鉴别，慎职尽才名。\n燕集归无几，莺迁去有程。\n能将此别意，播入古人声。\n慷慨上世训，徘徊知己情。\n椽笛随歌咽，匏樽杂泪倾。\n籍籍今安定，翩翩老向平。\n清欢苦未足，远道本难轻。\n自合酬天子，何因变友生。\n惟余儆义范，垂死独牵萦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"刘麟","text":"红稀天有情，绿暗春无兴。\n游子雨中眠，梦里年光尽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看月","author":"刘麟","text":"满月昔未满，清辉常恨谁。\n请看亏欲尽，正是有情时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宾旭堂述懒","author":"刘麟","text":"骑马不如昔，寻僧怯上船。\n山中农务息，怀抱白云眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中答馈药二首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"坐室延师易，登城取药难。\n感君传递至，蹴踏试寻山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中答馈药二首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"肺病经冬苦，仙丹此日传。\n若能安枕卧，徐问董公年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过王履吉墓二首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"岁序严凝日，仙踪断隔时。\n荒途无古剑，高冢有新枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过王履吉墓二首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"壮岁同游地，今晨独到时。\n夜台无健笔，残菊有空枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋江","author":"刘麟","text":"烨烨有奇色，紫云无数新。\n含咀得至理，终属商山人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16853,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄故人","author":"刘麟","text":"蒲苇三秋渺，云霞一雁鸣。\n片帆江海梦，无限别离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16854,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种花二首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"好事今馀几，频年不在家。\n老兴层台上，担灯夜种花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16855,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种花二首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"旧土新铺石，登临日几回。\n若逢双足老，与我看花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16856,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙津门径二首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"潭水澄清静里心，紫云常护紫姑神。\n耽游谁似文夫子，肖出丹丘赠与人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16857,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙津门径二首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"终岁寻真未得真，归舟犹幸及残春。\n吾家玉女潭如玉，入谷通天自隔尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16858,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓上兴庄","author":"刘麟","text":"苍苍原野思依依，咫尺茅峰东与西。\n空斋养性无人共，午夜时闻鸡一啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16859,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有竹山居二首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"懒残吟眺过春时，芳恨犹传石上诗。\n天遣风云常爱护，莫教磨灭共花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16860,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有竹山居二首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"佳城寂寂长莓苔，纵我临观日几回。\n千载松楸人共老，飞凫常向月中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16861,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄闻一山二咏 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"排山风雨正怀人，阻绝江舟自有神。\n池塘春草今晨梦，自插荆花满角巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16862,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄闻一山二咏 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"茅屋新营独贮春，自甘清苦作閒人。\n一尊清醑墙头过，不用陶家漉酒巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16863,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居二咏 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"山空睡起鸟音稀，平野虚堂万象辉。\n白发翁来苍柏下，一樽徐论桔槔非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16864,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀溧尹王从喜","author":"刘麟","text":"记得空堂酌我时，角巾清夜雨丝丝。\n道机谈罢双凫去，秋草芊芊满路岐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16865,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹅","author":"刘麟","text":"城南秋草碧于烟，无数白鹅随我船。\n风帆乍举惊呼散，拍水过溪相对眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16866,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题明妃图","author":"刘麟","text":"黄云白碛戍楼空，汉殿音微有雁通。\n纤纤残月迢迢梦，犹在昭阳女伴中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16867,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中偶成","author":"刘麟","text":"林扉过雨晓风开，曲径花香碧涧回。\n一卷道书寻未得，山禽飞过竹梢来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16868,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞霞阁二首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"万松如盖拥祥烟，百尺名台聚两川。\n岁岁春风吹杖履，与君同醉玉楼前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16869,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞霞阁二首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"晓日舒情春可怜，轻风吹送艳阳天。\n泗洲堂下深杯后，又醉桃花细雨前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16870,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上兴别墅答李空同学宪四首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"当年事事欲探奇，老大无成只旧时。\n卧隐空山朝倦起，却囊棋子谢人诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16871,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上兴别墅答李空同学宪四首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"坐深杨柳水边枝，似懒都忘是昔时。\n寄得诗来如对语，不知雷电满龙池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16872,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上兴别墅答李空同学宪四首 其三","author":"刘麟","text":"孤坐岩扉意若何，澄清万象合天多。\n神明不逐诸魔散，玉露光风转至和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16873,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上兴别墅答李空同学宪四首 其四","author":"刘麟","text":"玉露光风有至和，道人何物竟蹉跎。\n如颜尚恨违三月，似孟还须集义多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16874,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒情","author":"刘麟","text":"道人习性似鸠偏，半世无家半住船。\n书画捲来刚一束，愁风愁雨过年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16875,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵话轩","author":"刘麟","text":"春谷草生残雪际，石门人去夕阳时。\n自将数数穷幽秘，只恐邻墙道士知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16876,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"刘麟","text":"芙蓉易采波难涉，只恐神龟住香叶。\n月斜欹枕梦还佳，道情不乱庄周蝶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16877,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慨时","author":"刘麟","text":"尽瘁空悲亦罔功，渭滨老子独从容。\n当时诸葛成何事，只合终身作卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16878,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新筑台登玩","author":"刘麟","text":"永日登台当一年，不风不雨更忻然。\n门无俗辙身无病，何必飞升始是仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16879,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逢僧","author":"刘麟","text":"怀玄默默向谁探，小寺逢僧始一参。\n日暮孤舟风浪息，满蓬花雨自毵毵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16880,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题庐山图","author":"刘麟","text":"昼锦堂开醉客时，蟠桃岁岁与山期。\n楚人欲献知何物，㩦取匡庐到酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16881,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偶成三首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"日红方是睡醒时，浣濯从容出每迟。\n帘幕乍开春正浅，细吟生理上花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16882,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偶成三首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"春园无客昼常关，高阁沉沉便见山。\n燕子倏来还倏去，有时繁语破人閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16883,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偶成三首 其三","author":"刘麟","text":"竹床深处昼烹茶，上有长松下有花。\n鱼跃鸢飞池半亩，不须重问玉皇家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16884,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道养","author":"刘麟","text":"莫将朝市笑山林，一刻清和抵万金。\n学到坐忘遗照处，世间何物更关心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16885,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜月爇香","author":"刘麟","text":"谁寄名香到草堂，山童惊爇煮茶忙。\n偶然风定月亦至，一缕轻烟百尺长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16886,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡湖","author":"刘麟","text":"广文遗韵留樗散，鸡犬图书共一船。\n自说江湖不归事，阻风中酒过年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16887,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀","author":"刘麟","text":"卧听溪声枕簟凉，怀人中夜揽衣裳。\n风雷偶作淙淙雨，犬宿鸡啼共一房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16888,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与闻一山惜别二咏 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"培塿槁壤藏蚯蚓，寂寞寒江走蠹鱼。\n公论百年求断案，送穷文字绝交书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16889,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与闻一山惜别二咏 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"君如阳鸟随阳至，兴薄云天亦苦寒。\n极目字行中断处，月明芦荻又江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16890,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与文衡山三首 其一","author":"刘麟","text":"长烟树杪见群山，过雨亭前响碧滩。\n暮色牵情不知去，唤谁来共倚栏干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与文衡山三首 其二","author":"刘麟","text":"湿云初敛见横山，百道鸣泉落远滩。\n诗在眼中无客共，兴随飞瀑远长干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与文衡山三首 其三","author":"刘麟","text":"水长平芜两岸齐，千峰回合树高低。\n正怜虚寂存吾道，莫遣时人识此溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑坦上","author":"刘麟","text":"秋风诛茅结草庐，庭容旋马地无馀。\n面山临水足真意，与儿对窗俱读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨松泉水亭","author":"刘麟","text":"直穷幽胜扫莓苔，竹里虚亭向水开。\n天上重阳且风雨，飞凫时过五湖来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16895,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三月十日饮半溪家","author":"刘麟","text":"长幼鱼鱼鼓枻来，正愁春尽拟登台。\n尧夫玩易图南睡，说梦逢痴亦怪哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16896,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻马千里店有衡翁画可买上有楼未赠先题","author":"刘麟","text":"梦卜乾坤第一流，明王图治说殷周。\n商岩渭水传真处，千仞丹崖有似楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16897,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"殊胜寺","author":"刘麟","text":"乍逢琴鹤碧湖来，披毼匆匆夕举杯。\n意得乳羊扳一醉，博公嘲笑下三台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16898,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟于石川舟睹北楼卷","author":"刘麟","text":"津吏传呼太宰来，米家船里似楼开。\n阳关唱彻瞻辰卧，南极何年接上台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16899,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王国仪贰守之温州","author":"孙绪","text":"渺渺南徐江，望望东嘉城。\n清时宦游地，咫尺江边程。\n朝与里人辞，暮见郡人迎。\n风定野云湿，沙暄水鸟鸣。\n扁舟泛孤鹤，翛然有馀清。\n俊才饶用世，良士惜休名。\n想见海塘上，一夕春水生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16900,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云深图","author":"孙绪","text":"云从山气生，还向山中住。\n苍生望霖雨，玄豹文烟雾。\n幽人爱静观，结屋云山路。\n绕径莓苔润，当窗编简护。\n杖藜腰脚健，歌咏风雷布。\n云来冥思迟，云去天光著。\n俯首见人寰，尘氛自来去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16901,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李璞还山东","author":"孙绪","text":"门墙识君初，君少我已长。\n我长亦何用，君少多清响。\n感君友于意，绸缪下深广。\n夜雨床对眠，春风驾屡枉。\n别来问眉宇，虚幻渺难像。\n独闻荆树花，垂荫低可仰。\n往岁见君弟，言论际穹壤。\n翻恨未逢君，千里入神想。\n侵晨叩门扉，举目见豪爽。\n喜极欲绝倒，惊定还询访。\n初疑梦未真，既省心独恍。\n以兹念旧游，悲叹废心赏。\n流光过孤隼，薄俗轻五两。\n谁能久低徊，惙惙婴世网。\n京洛多风尘，长江没浩荡。\n羡君冠佩去，终岁住林莽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16902,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戈宇清上舍便面","author":"孙绪","text":"家住清江边，来往江上路。\n扁舟惯风雨，清流爱情素。\n种竹满江浒，大半裁渔具。\n垂竿蛟龙长，横笛沧浪度。\n平生济川心，付彼沙头鹭。\n闻说东海上，昏昏气成雾。\n留取丝纶手，终与鳌鲸遇。\n朝出江头渔，暮出江头渔。\n朝暮此中事，自有周王书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16903,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妾薄命","author":"孙绪","text":"妾命薄，薄如纸。\n君意陌上尘，妾意江边水。\n陌尘易飞扬，江水绝清泚。\n京兆多倾城，永别从今始。\n京兆犹自可，莫入临邛市。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16904,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠医士王廷弼","author":"孙绪","text":"古医不可见，世医恒碌碌。\n方书盈架阁，谁识机与轴。\n王君飘洒姿，石泉浸寒玉。\n平生秘异术，一览不复读。\n晓雨沐杏花，清风荡兰谷。\n月夜琴数声，永日棋一局。\n都将国手能，写作阳春曲。\n我生与君游，弱质藉君育。\n作诗三致谢，韶光正红绿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16905,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意二首 其一","author":"孙绪","text":"凄凄途中人，潇潇天上雨。\n霖雨若为情，长途谁是主。\n赠君箧中巾，心愁千万绪。\n盈盈清泪痕，脉脉屈指数。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16906,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意二首 其二","author":"孙绪","text":"凄凄途中人，青青路傍柳。\n柳叶思君眉，柳线思君手。\n赠君金步摇，侑以双琼玖。\n擢发数新愁，新愁今又陡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16907,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"老蚌明珠歌","author":"孙绪","text":"水边有老蚌，自分身已腐。\n岁久没泥沙，命贱等尘土。\n一朝孕明珠，瑞气笼天宇。\n翕张役月华，溯游召风雨。\n河伯与海若，驩呼竞跳舞。\n遹来掌上看，暗室光吞吐。\n平生照乘姿，连城价自古。\n不同鱼目混，肯作鹬喙哺。\n薏苡自满庭，陋贱谁比数。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16908,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春愁送刘侯归云中六首 其一","author":"孙绪","text":"黯黯拥春愁，迟日苦难旰。\n风鸣杨柳树，幽鸟时相唤。\n独携一樽酒，坐爱花容粲。\n念君明日去，对景成感叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16909,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春愁送刘侯归云中六首 其二","author":"孙绪","text":"君去何匆匆，我心日恻恻。\n遥望东园花，憔悴无颜色。\n送君出前途，惶惑忘南北。\n我车岂不良，我马岂不力。\n有具将安施，多岐迥无极。\n归来检文字，成败渺难识。\n古今趋一途，抛书空叹息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16910,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春愁送刘侯归云中六首 其三","author":"孙绪","text":"古人重在民，今人重在官。\n官威日赫赫，民力何能宽。\n县吏夜持符，赋役纷无端。\n春蚕寒未下，春苗生未繁。\n急解妇子裾，典当充朝餐。\n生计岂不念，所惜肢体残。\n大位取快意，不问穷途寒。\n卓哉阳亢宗，芳声今未刊。\n君去谁当语，俛首摧心肝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":16911,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]